# Mock UI tests (Cypress + Playwright)

Browser UI with a **mocked API**—not live e2e (`e2e-tests`) and not Jest components (`mock-component-tests`).

- Prefer the `mock-ui-test-author` skill. Write **both** Cypress and Playwright unless the user names one framework.
- Specs: `cypress/tests/e2e/mock-ui/*.cy.ts`, `playwright/e2e/mock-ui/*.spec.ts`.
- Stub network with Cypress `cy.intercept` or Playwright `page.route`; assert visible UI via page objects (`data-testid`).
- Auth still via `loginAsCustomer` / `loginAsAdmin`, then navigate with the page object.
- Keep Cypress and Playwright journeys aligned. Prefer `page-object-author` when extending POs.
